WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.900
Follow the transmission. Discover how gears change speed and the direction of motion.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.900
Explore different mechanisms. Gears, worms and pulleys: each family has a role.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.900
Build your own machine. Combine multiple gears and stack reduction stages.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.900
Choose your parts. Add gears of different sizes, motors, pulleys and loads.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.900
Understand what you see. Illustrated lessons connect the parts, dimensions and mechanisms.

